{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06348","headline":"望鸣臯山白云寄洛阳卢主簿 · 李颀","name":"望鸣臯山白云寄洛阳卢主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饮马伊水中，白云鸣臯上。\n氛氲山绝顶，行子时一望。\n照日龙虎姿，攒空冰雪状。\n嵡嵸殊未已，崚嶒忽相向。\n皎皎横绿林，霏霏澹青嶂。\n远映村更失，孤高鹤来傍。\n胜气欣有逢，仙游且难访。\n故人吏京剧，每事多闲放。\n室画峨眉峯，心格洞庭浪。\n惜哉清兴里，不见予所尚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}